singing of love.

517
01:02:55,543 --> 01:02:59,403
零れ落ちた花びらが
The fallen petals

518
01:02:59,863 --> 01:03:02,883
寂しさの跡を隠した
hid the traces of loneliness.

519
01:03:03,283 --> 01:03:06,563
ねえ 早く迎えに来て
Hey, come meet me quickly—

520
01:03:07,183 --> 01:03:11,323
最後のひとひらが落ちるその前に
before the last petal falls.

521
01:03:13,183 --> 01:03:16,823
今はどんな花とも群れないの
Right now, I won't flock with any other flowers;

522
01:03:17,323 --> 01:03:20,103
あなただけを待ってる
I am waiting only for you.

523
01:03:20,363 --> 01:03:26,703
あなたとならこの体が壊されたってもう構わない
If it's with you, I don't care even if this body is broken.

524
01:03:28,083 --> 01:03:31,143
棘に触れたら傷つくわ
Touching thorns will hurt you;

525
01:03:31,443 --> 01:03:37,543
その覚悟がないならいっそここから消えてよ
if you don't have that resolve, then just disappear from here!

526
01:03:38,083 --> 01:03:42,703
重く閉ざした シークレットガーデン
Heavily closed Secret Garden.

527
01:03:48,423 --> 01:03:50,923
夜風はリゾルート
The night wind is resolute.

528
01:03:51,443 --> 01:03:54,543
白い薔薇は覚醒する
The white rose awakens,

529
01:03:55,283 --> 01:03:57,883
背中押されるように
as if pushed from behind,

530
01:03:58,183 --> 01:04:01,923
扉開いた
and the door opens.

531
01:04:02,483 --> 01:04:06,163
ただ独りで枯れてゆくの？
Will it just wither away all alone?

532
01:04:06,903 --> 01:04:09,623
待ってるだけじゃいられない
I can't just sit here waiting.

533
01:04:10,343 --> 01:04:13,663
衝動の赴くまま
Following my impulses,

534
01:04:13,963 --> 01:04:18,323
茨の道を裸足で駆け抜けてく
I run barefoot through the thorny path.

535
01:04:19,863 --> 01:04:23,343
凛と咲き誇る華でありたい
I want to be a flower blooming proudly.

536
01:04:24,083 --> 01:04:27,183
あなただけを求めて
Yearning only for you,

537
01:04:27,743 --> 01:04:32,583
逢いにゆくの どんな遠く離れていても見つけ出せる
I'll go to meet you. No matter how far apart, I can find you.

538
01:04:34,623 --> 01:04:37,603
暗い世界も怖くない
A dark world is not scary anymore

539
01:04:38,003 --> 01:04:40,463
あなたを感じるから
because I feel you.

540
01:04:41,003 --> 01:04:44,083
全て失ったっていい
It's okay if I lose everything;

541
01:04:44,483 --> 01:04:49,583
二度と戻らない そうシークレットガーデン
it will never return, yes, the Secret Garden.

542
01:05:18,374 --> 01:05:22,094
今はどんな花とも群れないの
Right now, I won't flock with any other flowers...

543
01:05:22,354 --> 01:05:25,594
あなただけを求めて
Seeking only you...

544
01:05:25,874 --> 01:05:28,914
霞の向こう わたしを呼ぶ
Calling out to me beyond the mist...

545
01:05:29,414 --> 01:05:34,194
鮮やかに燃える強き薔薇
A brightly burning, strong rose...

546
01:05:35,194 --> 01:05:38,794
凛と咲き誇る華でありたい
I want to be a flower blooming proudly and gracefully.

547
01:05:39,014 --> 01:05:42,714
やっとここで出逢えた
We finally met right here...

548
01:05:43,054 --> 01:05:49,594
あなたとなら この体が 壊されたってもう構わない
With you, I wouldn't care if this body were broken anymore.

549
01:05:49,894 --> 01:05:53,074
棘に触れたら 傷つくわ
If you touch the thorns, you'll get hurt.

550
01:05:53,334 --> 01:05:56,654
その覚悟があるのね
You have that resolve, don't you?

551
01:05:56,914 --> 01:06:04,334
手を取り合えばひろがる 誰も知らない そう Sacred Universe
If we join hands, it expands into a world no one knows, yes, Sacred Universe.

